<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse Electric.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse Electric.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz said it initiated coverage of Westinghouse Electric Corp and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $31 a share.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Westinghouse lost 4/16 to 24-3/16.</p>
